WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,460 --> 00:00:03,100
Waiting half a life for nothing

2
00:00:03,740 --> 00:00:04,940
die for country

3
00:00:05,570 --> 00:00:08,970
It’s considered atoning for today.

4
00:00:09,050 --> 00:00:10,930
I, An Qiaoqiao, in the name of the owner of the An family

5
00:00:11,010 --> 00:00:12,450
Here’s to you all, a glass of Zhuangxing wine

6
00:00:12,810 --> 00:00:13,730
This cup is introduced

7
00:00:13,810 --> 00:00:14,730
Huangquan Road

8
00:00:14,810 --> 00:00:17,170
You don’t go alone to settle down

9
00:00:17,650 --> 00:00:19,090
Be equal to your son

10
00:00:22,630 --> 00:00:24,230
Die for Sister An

11
00:00:24,430 --> 00:00:34,070
Don’t worry about giving money

12
00:00:34,350 --> 00:00:35,580
Took life money

13
00:00:35,660 --> 00:00:37,260
Give me your life and stay in Longmucheng

14
00:00:37,420 --> 00:00:40,020
I'll give you a rest on behalf of Anjia and Xiaguo.

15
00:00:40,100 --> 00:00:42,180
So rich to get

16
00:00:42,420 --> 00:00:45,260
Have a good reputation and be expensive

17
00:00:45,340 --> 00:00:47,260
I can also make Master An’s family kowtow.

18
00:00:47,500 --> 00:00:50,180
Send the money to my mother and tell her that her son is a fool
